1
00:00:00,395 --> 00:00:01,715
Excuse me, ladies and gentlemen.

2
00:00:01,715 --> 00:00:03,560
I hope you enjoyed your meal.

3
00:00:04,035 --> 00:00:09,260
Personally, I found it to be an absolute feast, and I'd like to thank the organizers for their marvelous work.

4
00:00:09,635 --> 00:00:16,455
It's time to move on to the more formal part of the evening, which comprises the awards for journalist and photojournalist of the year.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,775
This year has been a particularly dark and dangerous one for journalists working in war zones.

6
00:00:22,255 --> 00:00:30,915
I can only say how much I admire and respect those courageous writers and photographers who have risked death and even torture in order to bring the truth to the world.

7
00:00:31,615 --> 00:00:34,755
Would everyone please give a big round of applause for our chief editor?

8
00:00:35,255 --> 00:00:37,475
He is going to present our first award.
